{"id":"n15808-2-7","stage":3,"title":"바싹 · 紧紧地","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15808-2-7-1","ko":"누군가 다가오는 것 같아. 무서워.","zh":"好像有人过来了。好可怕。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누군가","meaning":"谁，某某，有人","explanation":"누구：谁，某某，有人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"3","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누군가","audio":"/audio/09cdd1dd218a0acf72bd.mp3"}},{"text":"다가오는","meaning":"走近","explanation":"다가오다：走近；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"다가오다","audio":"/audio/8bf5adeea3b4b934f783.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73864","senseId":"1","lemma":"다가오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다가오는","audio":"/audio/c9d0d7136fbf9a875379.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}},{"text":"무서워.","meaning":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","explanation":"무섭다：怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"1","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무서워","audio":"/audio/921bc08fcad14842acb2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁，某某，有人","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指无须透露姓名的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"8bf5adeea3b4b934","term":"다가오다","zh":"走近","audio":"/audio/8bf5adeea3b4b934f783.mp3","entryId":"73864","definition":"移步到某个对象的近处。","pronunciation":["다가오다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"忌讳某个对象或担心出什么事。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]}],"audio":"/audio/57b8a7de10da276f1eec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15808-2-7-2","ko":"바싹 엎드리고 여기서 기다려. 내가 나가 볼게.","zh":"赶紧趴下，在这里等着。我出去看看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바싹","meaning":"紧紧地","explanation":"바싹：紧紧地","readings":[{"term":"바싹","audio":"/audio/257fc21cc7418168fc56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15808","senseId":"2","lemma":"바싹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바싹","audio":"/audio/257fc21cc7418168fc56.mp3"}},{"text":"엎드리고","meaning":"卧，趴","explanation":"엎드리다：卧，趴；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"엎드리다","audio":"/audio/96276df0293f6631a799.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15199","senseId":"1","lemma":"엎드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엎드리고","audio":"/audio/061d7500e76024952b98.mp3"}},{"text":"여기서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기서","audio":"/audio/507960116aed3699ca8f.mp3"}},{"text":"기다려.","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다려","audio":"/audio/45f50f6f6dc05f2c8c0a.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"나가","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"22","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가","audio":"/audio/2ea9b6f2f116b0039a33.mp3"}},{"text":"볼게.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼게","audio":"/audio/a292c0eb2f3447e049d3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"257fc21cc7418168","term":"바싹","zh":"紧紧地","audio":"/audio/257fc21cc7418168fc56.mp3","entryId":"15808","definition":"非常紧贴或靠近的样子。","pronunciation":["바싹"]},{"id":"96276df0293f6631","term":"엎드리다","zh":"卧，趴","audio":"/audio/96276df0293f6631a799.mp3","entryId":"15199","definition":"肚子朝下，全身贴在地面。","pronunciation":["업뜨리다"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciati